# Reset a password

### 1. Open the **console**

![Open the console](images/01-open-the-console.png)

> **Decision:** Are you an *administrator*?
>
> - **Yes:** Go to “Admins” (Step 2)
> - **No:** Go to “Everyone else” (Step 3)
> - **Already reset:** Go to Step 4
> - Go to the guide “Unlock an account”

## Admins

*For: Admin*

### 2. Open **Users** and choose *Reset*

![Open Users and choose Reset](images/02-open-users-and-choose-reset.png)

## Everyone else

*For: User, Guest*

### 3. Ask an administrator

![Ask an administrator](images/03-ask-an-administrator.png)

## Finish

### 4. Sign out

![Sign out](images/04-sign-out.png)
